Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 11:07:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] Archive Uttaradi institutional contacts (165) and seva
 offerings (16)

Office/branch phone numbers tied to a place, not personal numbers of
named individuals -- checked deliberately before archiving, distinct
from the Vishwesha app's personal pontiff-phone directory which stays
unarchived. Matches the architecture doc's "official contacts"
institutional-knowledge domain; mathas.json has a null contact field per
matha waiting for exactly this kind of data.

