+  "verification_status": "needs_review",
+  "notes": "contacts.json is contact_table: 165 rows of institutional/office phone numbers for branch sannidhis, research centres, and publications -- these are organizational numbers tied to a place/institution, NOT personal mobile numbers of named individuals (contrast with the Vishwesha app's ph.vss, a pontiffs' personal-phone directory deliberately left unarchived -- see dge/sources/vishwesha_panchanga's manifest). Still flagged rights_status UNKNOWN, not asserted clean, but this is the kind of institutional 'official contacts' data the architecture doc's institutional-knowledge model explicitly wants (mathas.json even has a currently-null 'contact' field per matha waiting to be filled from a verified source). 'state' field is inconsistently capitalized/spelled in the source (Bengaluru/Bangalore/bengaluru all appear) -- kept as-is, not normalized, since this is a raw acquisition archive. seva.json is seva_table joined with seva_item_table (16 active seva offerings with their priced sub-items) -- donation/ritual-offering information, no personal devotee records.",
+  "next_step": "Normalization/dedup of the state field and wiring into mathas.json's branches/contact fields is a Phase 2 task, not done here -- this manifest covers acquisition only."
